        "TileImage": "$($repository 1202735a-0216-4305-ad76-ab59e469561f).Image",
        "Description": "47, an orginization by the name of the GMA (which stands for the Gay Mom Association) has been protesting about various issues troubling society. Regardless or not if you agree or disagree with their ideas, their protests have turned violent. Because many of the GMA members are also members of the Ark Society, they decided that the Isle of Sgail would be the perfect place to discuss upcoming revolutions. Your job is to intercept the female pests and ensure they don&apos;t cause a problem. Good luck.",
